        CALL CHARA_TEXT(48,@"「Huh, really?」","w")
        PRINTFORMDW Louise seems intrigued.
        CALL CHARA_TEXT(48,@"「Back home, Yumeko always took care of that stuff.」","w")
        PRINTFORMDW Nemuno clicks her tongue.
        PRINTFORMW 「Well, you'd best thank her next time y'head back home!」
        PRINTFORML 「Anyway, first I get up before sunrise t'chop wood...」
        PRINTFORMDW Nemuno continues telling Louise about a typical day in her life.

    CASE 60
        CALL CHARA_TEXT(60,@"「Is it true that you hunt all of your own food?」","w")
        PRINTFORMW 「Yep.」
        PRINTFORMDW Nemuno smiles proudly.
        PRINTFORMW 「Been doin' it fer... oh, about 800 years now?」
        CALL CHARA_TEXT(60,@"「That's... very impressive.」","w")
        PRINTFORMDW Parsee's voice sounds a little strained.

    CASE 141
        PRINTFORMDW Chimata rubs her chin as she looks at Nemuno.
        CALL CHARA_TEXT(141,@"「Hmm... no, I don't think we've made an Ability Card based off of you yet. Do you have any ideas?」","w")
        PRINTFORMW 「Depends. What's in it fer me?」
        CALL CHARA_TEXT(141,@"「Well...」","w")
        PRINTFORMDW A grin creeps onto Chimata's face.
        CALL CHARA_TEXT(141,@"「Did you know that every Ability Card has a royalty rate included in the price? Every time someone sells one, my magic makes it so you get paid the royalty fee automagically!」","w")
        CALL CHARA_TEXT(141,@"「For instance, if your Ability Card sells for 100 yen, and your royalty rate is 10\%, you'll get paid 10 yen from that sale. And you don't even have to do anything! It's basically free money!」","w")
        PRINTFORMW 「Free money, y'say?」
        PRINTFORMDW Nemuno looks intrigued.
        PRINTFORMW 「You've got my attention.」
        PRINTFORMDW Chimata and Nemuno continue to discuss business...

    CASE 142
        PRINTFORMDW Nemuno looks suspiciously at Momoyo.
        PRINTFORMW 「You n'yer boss're takin' care not to risk underminin' anyone's homes, right?」
        PRINTFORMDW Momoyo snorts.
        CALL CHARA_TEXT(142,@"「'Course we are! What kinda operation do you think we're running here?」","w")
        CALL CHARA_TEXT(142,@"「\"Safety first\", that's my motto.」","w")
        CALL CHARA_TEXT(142,@"「Besides, none of our tunnels are going anywhere near any populated areas. We're mostly digging down, not out.」","w")
